@startuml
title FootInTheDoor - Broad System Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Sanbor marketing, sales,\nand manufacturer's reps" as Users
actor "Researcher / data maintainer\n(proposed responsibility)" as Researcher
actor "EMSDC\nStakeholder feedback and evaluation" as EMSDC
rectangle "Sanbor inputs\nExisting target list\nProducts and capabilities\nKnown relationships and trigger examples" as Inputs
rectangle "Permitted research sources\nPublic business information\nAvailable Sanbor / Drexel resources" as Sources
rectangle "FootInTheDoor\nOne integrated company intelligence tool\n\nWhich companies fit?\nWho matters at the right unit or location?\nHow could Sanbor get in?\nWhy pursue this company now?" as Platform
rectangle "Actionable company profile\nFit and priority rationale\nRelevant people and roles\nPractical entry points\nOpportunity evidence and next steps\nSources, dates, and uncertainty" as Profile

Users --> Platform : Select targets and\nreview research
Inputs --> Platform : Supply business context
Sources --> Researcher : Supply research evidence
Researcher --> Platform : Maintain sourced findings
Platform --> Profile : Organize findings
Profile --> Users : Support prioritization\nand outreach decisions
EMSDC ..> Platform : Help test and refine concept

note bottom of Platform
  Sanbor is the initial test partner.
  Longer-term goal: support other suppliers.
end note
@enduml
